swimlane Six-pool message ring
// Limit: six pools in a ring of message flows (pool-to-pool, pool-to-node, node-to-pool, node-to-node), with collapsed pools in the middle of the stack. Check arrows route around lane bodies and stay legible.
subtitle Rumour travels the Seven Seas

pool Tortuga Tavern
  ~> Sailor Hub

pool Sailor Hub
  ~> Port Royal

pool Port Royal
  lane Governor blue
    (Rumour) message -> Dispatch letter
    Dispatch letter type: send
      ~> Admiralty
      -> <Reply?>
    <Reply?>
      -yes-> Read reply
      -no-> Dispatch letter
    Read reply type: receive -> (Known) success
  lane Spy gray
    Eavesdrop type: manual, note: Tavern walls are thin
      ~> Tortuga Tavern
      -> Eavesdrop

pool Admiralty
  lane Clerk orange
    (Letter) message -> File letter
    File letter type: user -> Write reply
    Write reply type: send
      ~> Read reply
      -> (Sealed)

pool Smugglers' Cove
  ~> Tortuga Tavern

pool Kraken's Lair
  ~> Smugglers' Cove
